Package: enrichVolcano
Title: Composite Volcano and Enrichment Ring Plots for Proteomics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dustyn", "Tubbs", , "dtlts14@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds composite volcano and enrichment ring plots from
    differential abundance results. Accepts UniProt-keyed per-contrast CSVs
    plus tidy, wide, DEP, proteoDA, limma, DESeq2, edgeR, MSstats, proDA,
    DEqMS, MaxQuant, and Perseus inputs. Supports pi-score variants (Xiao
    2014), several p-value adjustment methods, and fgsea or ORA enrichment
    against MSigDB, Reactome, KEGG, Gene Ontology, MitoCarta, CORUM, and GO
    Slim gene sets across seven species.
